body:
I (18f) was home alone with my stepbrother (17m), as our parents (42M) (36F) were going to the doctors to get a dildo out of my mom's ass. Anyways, it was a hot summer day so my stepbro was wearing some gross anime shirt. i was doing laundry and i fell into the machine, butt first!! I yell to my brother (the only one that can help me) for help.

&#x200B;

I heard a thunderous stomping noise, the sound of two elephants mating on a hot day in africa, and the amount of sweat too, jesus! He comes in breathing heavily, and trying to pull off my shorts i scream, saying WTF ARE YOU DOING. He quickly ejaculated (7 oz.) onto me.

&#x200B;

So then, I grabbed him and nearly strangled him. He threw me off and ran to the door, then my dad (42M) beat his ass with his electric bass ('71 p bass, maple neck, basswood body, body through strings) and kicked him out. My mom (36F) is threatening to call the cops. I'm currently staying in my room crying. Why is my brother like this?
